	quest.0209B0C9E433620A.quest_desc: [
		"&dSpells&r can be created in a &5scroll forge&r with an &2ingredient&r, paper and ink, the better the ink the higher the tier of the &dspell&r. The &2ingredient&r corresponds to the &3category&r it is. &4Spells are random.&r"
		""
		"&3There are 9 catagories of magic:&r"
		""
		"&7Evocation (emerald)&r, &aNature(rotten potato)&r, &bIce(frozen bone)&r, &eHoly(divine pearl)&r, &6Fire(blaze rod)&r, &3Lighting(bottle o' lightning)&r, &4Blood(blood vial)&r and last of all &5Eldritch (echo shard)&r"
	]
